{"id":1040703,"chapter_id":1040703,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"<color=#7683a2><i>见证、观察、核实。事情的对与错黑白分明，看到有人犯错就喊出来，直到对方获得相应的惩罚。\n是非没有暧昧的中间区域，也不会有人因为干好事受到伤害。\n对小时候的我来说，正义就是这么简单的事情。</i></color>","style":14,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"？？","content":"——这位小朋友，你长大后想做些什么呢？","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_2"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"小女孩努力踮起脚，她高高地仰着头，这才算够到麦克风的高度。","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"speaker":"小毕安卡","content":"我……我想当正义又勇敢的苹果战士！","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"speaker":"小毕安卡","content":"苹果战士拥有最最强大的力量，他可以找出所有躲藏起来的大坏蛋，把他们揪出来接受惩罚！我也想当这样帅气的人！","female_content":"苹果战士拥有最最强大的力量，她可以找出所有躲藏起来的大坏蛋，把他们揪出来接受惩罚！我也想当这样帅气的人！","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_5","vo_trial_40703_1_5f"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"speaker":"？？","content":"那你是想当<color=#fb9259>记者</color>吗？","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"content":"小女孩一本正经地思考了很久，才再次开口。","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"speaker":"小毕安卡","content":"唔……毕安卡没明白！“记者”也能做到苹果战士那样，惩罚坏蛋吗？","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"speaker":"？？","content":"很可惜，记者没有动画片里的神奇超能力。当记者不光要天天加班，到处调查受一肚子气，还容易遇到被坏蛋反制的情况哦？","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"speaker":"小毕安卡","content":"这样啊……那苹果不想当记者了，苹果失望……","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"女孩明显蔫了下来，这和她想象中帅气的身影截然相反。","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"speaker":"？？","content":"话是这么说，不过……","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"speaker":"？？","content":"有时候，狡猾的反派们会戴上面具偷偷潜伏到我们中间……即使苹果超人拥有无穷的力气，也不知道该把拳头打向哪里。","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"speaker":"？？","content":"这时就需要火眼金睛的记者小姐出马咯！正是有我们先抓到大坏蛋的狐狸尾巴，苹果超人才能知道坏家伙们在哪，然后——","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"speaker":"？？","content":"梆梆！狠狠踹他们的屁股！","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"speaker":"？？","content":"曝光坏蛋！这是惩罚坏蛋的第一步哦~","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"content":"小毕安卡听得激动，她学着动画片里超人的样子挥拳，眼中闪着兴奋的光。","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"speaker":"小毕安卡","content":"哇！超厉害，超帅！","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"speaker":"小毕安卡","content":"苹果想好了，苹果决定了！我想——","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"——我想拿下最佳新闻奖，成为新城第一的大记者！","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"content":"豪言壮语让室内的空气安静了几秒。","style":3,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"speaker":"面试官A","content":"这位同学，你的想法我们都听懂了，但……要不你先进行一下自我介绍？","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"啊？抱歉抱歉，我太激动了。","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"大家好我是毕安卡来自新城传媒大学新闻学院理想是成为记者拿下最佳新闻奖然后曝光所有应该受到惩罚的坏东西！这里是我的实习证明和社会实践活动记录——","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"content":"问答，致谢，结束。直到毕安卡推门离开后，两位面试官才从她激昂的语速中缓过神来。","style":3,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"speaker":"面试官A","content":"……如何？","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"speaker":"面试官B","content":"实习履历很优秀，切入视角很敏锐，笔头也扎实。虽然人有点过于热情……但对于新闻行业来说，这也算是件好事。","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"speaker":"面试官A","content":"行，那就决定是她了。","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_28"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703028,"trial_step":28},{"step":29,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"已经不行了——一个字都写不出来了——","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"speaker":"摩根","content":"……？","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"speaker":"摩根","content":"喂，这家伙又在上班时间喝“果汁”了？","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"speaker":"伊桑","content":"真可惜，今天还没。她刚被主编打回去本周的第四个选题，目前正在孵化第五个。","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_32"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"content":"毕安卡虚弱地举起手，气若游丝。","style":3,"background":2221,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"不好意思，已经是第六个了。","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"呜呜，这记者真是一天都当不下去了哭哭，我要回老家种苹果……","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"content":"摩根弹了弹毕安卡头上的苹果装饰，从她胳膊底下抽出那本写得密密麻麻的笔记。","style":3,"background":2221,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"speaker":"摩根","content":"行吧，来让前辈帮你参谋一下。我看看，“天价营养液幕后揭露”……老天，你又从哪搞来的冷门选题？","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"“开发大脑，提升潜能，连续服用一周即可生效！”听起来真酷，但你猜怎么着？他们宣称的补脑黑科技不过就是兑了点劣质添加剂而已！","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703038,"trial_step":38},{"step":39,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"但主编说类似的智商税报道太多了没什么话题度，让我换一个。","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_39"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703039,"trial_step":39},{"step":40,"speaker":"摩根","content":"那这个“FAC经费贪污调查”呢？","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"主编说选题挺好，但——“太危险了，你想让我们整个电视台被端掉吗？”","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"speaker":"摩根","content":"……或者这个呢，“某拾荒老人称废弃工厂闹鬼”？","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_42"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703042,"trial_step":42},{"step":43,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"这条是我自己删掉的。原本以为藏着什么幕后黑手，结果只是乌龙而已，还不如去街上抓乱扔饮料罐的小混混有意思……","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_43"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"content":"摩根把笔记本狠狠糊在毕安卡脸上。","style":3,"background":2221,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703044,"trial_step":44},{"step":45,"speaker":"摩根","content":"别废话，有得写就不错了，还挑起来了。","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_45"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703045,"trial_step":45},{"step":46,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"但报道这种闹剧有什么意思嘛！要我说，当记者就得面对现实迎难而上，从看似日常的生活中找到潜藏的罪恶然后狠狠昭告天下——","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"speaker":"伊桑","content":"没大案子不正说明现在世道安稳吗？多好。","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_47"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"speaker":"伊桑","content":"主编那么严格也是在保护你。有的调查钻得太深入反而容易被牵连，你的职业生涯还很长，这样不划算的。","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703048,"trial_step":48},{"step":49,"content":"刚入行的年轻记者显然并不服气，她抓起脸上的笔记本，一边翻一边嘀咕。","style":3,"background":2221,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703049,"trial_step":49},{"step":50,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"但我就是不服气嘛，明明有些人做错了事情，却还像没事人一样走在阳光下面……明明有那么多脏东西就藏在眼前，但大家就跟没看见一样无视掉！","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703050,"trial_step":50},{"step":51,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"难道视若无睹才是“正确”吗？我不同意！","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"做错了就该受到惩罚。如果没有其他记者站出来……","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703052,"trial_step":52},{"step":53,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"那就由我来踏出正义的第一步！","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2221,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703053,"trial_step":53},{"step":54,"content":"画面骤然定格，仿佛视频按下暂停键，所有人的动作凝固在上一瞬间。","style":3,"background":2221,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703054,"trial_step":54},{"step":55,"content":"<i>见证、观察、核实……对那时候的我来说，记者的工作和小时候拿大喇叭通报其他小朋友耍赖没什么区别。\n我让全世界知道有坏人的存在，然后看坏人被惩罚，正义就是这么简单的事情。\n就像和${PlayerName}潜入工厂那样，只要拍到证据发布在网上，正义的使者就会来执行审判。\n但是……正义并没有来。</i>","style":14,"background":2221,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703055,"trial_step":55},{"step":56,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"等等，这是什么意思？","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703056,"trial_step":56},{"step":57,"speaker":"主编","content":"你手上那件关于网络信息泄露的案子立刻暂停，不管你调查到什么程度，都到此为止了。","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703057,"trial_step":57},{"step":58,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"为什么？","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703058,"trial_step":58},{"step":59,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"那几个擅自曝光受害者现实身份的混球已经被扣押了，接下来只要把报道发出去，再努把力逆转舆论就能——","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_59"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703059,"trial_step":59},{"step":60,"speaker":"主编","content":"毕安卡。","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703060,"trial_step":60},{"step":61,"speaker":"主编","content":"关于这案子的报道，你一共发了几篇？","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_61"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703061,"trial_step":61},{"step":62,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"……四篇。","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_62"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703062,"trial_step":62},{"step":63,"speaker":"主编","content":"那在这段时间内，网上的讨论有因为你的报道而变化吗？那些叫得最凶的人，他们有点进去看你的报道吗？","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_63"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703063,"trial_step":63},{"step":64,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_64"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703064,"trial_step":64},{"step":65,"speaker":"主编","content":"或者再说现实点。你我都清楚，被抓的那几个只是被推出来挡刀的伥鬼，还有更多人在网线的另一头，你能把他们都抓出来吗？","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_65"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703065,"trial_step":65},{"step":66,"speaker":"主编","content":"不能吧，至少记者做不到。","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_66"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703066,"trial_step":66},{"step":67,"speaker":"主编","content":"毕安卡，你是个聪明人。一个聪明的记者更该知道自己能力的范围。","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_67"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703067,"trial_step":67},{"step":68,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"……就没有其他我可以做的了吗？","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_68"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703068,"trial_step":68},{"step":69,"speaker":"主编","content":"当然有。","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_69"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703069,"trial_step":69},{"step":70,"speaker":"主编","content":"放弃这个案子，然后换一个选题吧。","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_70"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2385,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703070,"trial_step":70},{"step":71,"content":"嘟——嘟——","style":3,"background":2219,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703071,"trial_step":71},{"step":72,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"喂？","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_72"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2219,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703072,"trial_step":72},{"step":73,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"还记得我吗？之前来采访你的记者毕安卡——没错没错，就是头上带着苹果的那个！","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_73"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2219,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703073,"trial_step":73},{"step":74,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"嗯嗯，别担心，一切都很顺利！我……我已经跟主编大人谈好了，等下一篇报道出来，全狄斯就都知道你是无辜的了，那些网暴你的家伙才是坏蛋！","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_74"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2219,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703074,"trial_step":74},{"step":75,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"什么？又有人在灰镜上发你的现实信息，还把你挂在投票上？太过分了！！","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_75"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2219,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703075,"trial_step":75},{"step":76,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"我还在继续调查灰镜，已经摸到他们服务器的线索了——总有一天绝对会把那些在网上胡说的家伙都揪出来，还你一个公道！","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_76"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2219,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703076,"trial_step":76},{"step":77,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"嗯？","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_77"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2219,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703077,"trial_step":77},{"step":78,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"自从住址被曝光后每天都有人上门骚扰……这样啊，你要搬家了吗？","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_78"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2219,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703078,"trial_step":78},{"step":79,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_79"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2219,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703079,"trial_step":79},{"step":80,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"……咦？喂喂？你那边好像信号不太好……好大的风声？","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_80"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2219,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703080,"trial_step":80},{"step":81,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"……等等，你现在在哪？","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_81"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2219,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703081,"trial_step":81},{"step":82,"content":"微弱的声音从听筒处传来。此前被忽略的线索在毕安卡脑中拼合，指向她最不愿意接受的结果。","style":3,"background":2219,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703082,"trial_step":82},{"step":83,"speaker":"绝望的声音","content":"……谢谢你，谢谢你一直愿意为我发声……对不起，但我已经撑不住了……","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_83"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":11,"background":2219,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703083,"trial_step":83},{"step":84,"speaker":"绝望的声音","content":"就这样吧。谢谢你，记者小姐。","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_84"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":11,"background":2219,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703084,"trial_step":84},{"step":85,"speaker":"绝望的声音","content":"永别了。","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_85"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":11,"background":2219,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703085,"trial_step":85},{"step":86,"content":"毕安卡站在天台侧缘，面无表情地俯视下方城市。","style":3,"background":2223,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703087,"trial_step":87},{"step":87,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"……你应该听听他们是怎么“追悼”你的。","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_88"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2223,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703088,"trial_step":88},{"step":88,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"“死了？真是活该。哪个正经人会上暗网聊天的？是想红想疯了吧！”","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_89"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2223,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703089,"trial_step":89},{"step":89,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"“不好意思，我对老说自己是受害者的女生有偏见，哪有那么多困难啊，肯定就是自己太脆弱。”","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_90"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2223,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703090,"trial_step":90},{"step":90,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"还有这条，“笑死，说不定是假装可怜过几天又蹦出来收割流量了呢，嘻嘻。”","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_91"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2223,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703091,"trial_step":91},{"step":91,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"哈哈！明明是黑暗里的寄生虫，没被抓出来还不知道感恩戴德，仗着一层数据伪装就敢出来胡作非为……","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_92"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2223,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703092,"trial_step":92},{"step":92,"content":"屏幕上的评论被一字一句的念出来，毕安卡的语调也越发高昂，情绪也越来越激动。","style":3,"background":2223,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703093,"trial_step":93},{"step":93,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"对啊，曝光出真相又如何？哪儿有那么多正义的伙伴？即使把虫子暴晒在阳光里，他们也只会扭着身子继续爬回阴影，生生不息除不干净……","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_94"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2223,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703094,"trial_step":94},{"step":94,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"不是喜欢“曝光”别人吗？那就来吧，让黑暗互相啃咬自食其果，他们活该！","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_95"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2223,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703095,"trial_step":95},{"step":95,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"选择正义，执行正义！英勇的记者跨越艰难取得了制裁所有邪恶的力量！为了保护这座城市中其他善良的市民，必须把虫子们踩扁、碾碎，彻底杜绝后患！","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_96"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2223,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703096,"trial_step":96},{"step":96,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"投票的权力已经发给每一位用户……来改写结局吧，就让我们把这个令人作呕的故事，改造成<color=#fb9259>最完美的样子</color>。","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_97"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":2223,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703097,"trial_step":97},{"step":97,"content":"由于用户<color=#fb9259>特浓苹果汁2.0</color>在论坛中宣传不实言论，相关讨论已造成大规模不良影响。经多户举报后，本站点决定删除该账号下所有回贴、论坛中所有相关的讨论内容，并另对用户进行禁言处罚。\n\n<b>特此，对用户<color=#fb9259>特浓苹果汁2.0</color>处以永久封禁。该处置即刻生效，不可申诉解封。</b>","style":10,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703098,"trial_step":98},{"step":98,"content":"毕安卡看着屏幕上的封号通知，沉默不语。","style":3,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703099,"trial_step":99},{"step":99,"content":"但你敏锐察觉到毕安卡的情绪并不稳定，她身边的狂厄波动正在攀升，即将超出安全范围。","style":3,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703100,"trial_step":100},{"step":100,"options":["毕安卡，停下来"],"style":6,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703101,"trial_step":101,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"毕安卡，停下来","goto":102}]},{"step":101,"content":"深呼吸，平稳情绪。你要失控了。","style":2,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703102,"trial_step":102},{"step":102,"content":"你紧张地看着毕安卡，手中的枷锁蓄势待发。她没有抬头，过了很久才再次出声。","style":3,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703103,"trial_step":103},{"step":103,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"……哎呀，怎么又给你添麻烦了，明明约定要管好能力的，是我又食言了。","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_104"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703104,"trial_step":104},{"step":104,"content":"毕安卡仿佛就像你们第一次见面时那样语气轻快，没有失落。","style":3,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703105,"trial_step":105},{"step":105,"options":["你还好吗？"],"style":6,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703106,"trial_step":106,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"你还好吗？","goto":107}]},{"step":106,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"没事没事，这又不是第一次被封号，我早习惯了~","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_107"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703107,"trial_step":107},{"step":107,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"倒不如说这种敏感话题，发到就是赚到啦。只可惜刚刚造好的热度，就算再发一次估计也来不及了，看热闹的家伙早去关注别的帖子了。","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_108"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703108,"trial_step":108},{"step":108,"options":["别灰心"],"style":6,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703109,"trial_step":109,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"别灰心","goto":110}]},{"step":109,"content":"别灰心，我们还有机会——","style":2,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703110,"trial_step":110},{"step":110,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"那你说，我该怎么做？","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_111"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703111,"trial_step":111},{"step":111,"content":"毕安卡突然打断你的发言。","style":3,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703112,"trial_step":112},{"step":112,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"我该怎么做？","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_113"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703113,"trial_step":113},{"step":113,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"看见、记录、曝光、呐喊，我已经做了很多了，但事情却不了了之。","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_114"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703114,"trial_step":114},{"step":114,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"原来世界不是非黑即白的动画片，苹果战士也无法除掉所有坏蛋。那么多恶意伪装成人的样子，每次曝光都只让他们藏进更黑暗的阴影中。","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_115"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703115,"trial_step":115},{"step":115,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"我的曝光没有带来任何改变。","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_116"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703116,"trial_step":116},{"step":116,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"我的尝试也没有任何结果。","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_117"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703117,"trial_step":117},{"step":117,"content":"毕安卡终于转头看向你，笑容一如往常。","style":3,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703118,"trial_step":118},{"step":118,"speaker":"毕安卡","content":"局长呀，你说，我究竟还能做什么呢？","voice":["vo_trial_40703_1_119"],"voice_bank":"vo_bianca_trial","style":1,"background":1048,"log_type":1,"src_id":140703119,"trial_step":119}]}